  "details": "Allowing local only mirror prefabs to be placed on avatars (not just world's) could solve the issue of not having portable mirrors through game modification anymore. Because they are local only, it has no reason to affect the performance rating of an avatar.\nThey could also be disabled in specific world's marked as game world's etc. through the SDK by the world creator. This would stop people potentially cheating with mirrors and so on.",
